**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      ERROR MONITOR SUBROUTINE                                      *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBROUTINE IS TO INTERROGATE THE
*            CONTENTS OF THE ERROR MONITOR REGISTER, AND TO OUTPUT
*            ERROR MESSAGES WHEN AN ERROR IS DETECTED DURING THE
*            PERFORMANCE OF A PREFLIGHT ROUTINE.

* ENTRIES    EMS      ENTER WITH ERROR CODE IN ACCUMULATOR TO OUTPUT
*                     ERROR MESSAGE.
*                     ENTER WITH ZERO IN ACCUMULATOR TO INTERROGATE
*                     EMR.
*            EMSR     ENTER WITH ERROR CODE IN ACCUMULATOR AND ERROR
*                     IN V.EMR.

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA

DISR   BSS     1
EMRM   BSS     1
EMSCMD BSS     1
OLDSTT BSS     1
EMSRT  BSS     1

EMSR   STO     777          ENTER WITH EMW IN ACC, ERROR IN V.EMR
       STO     V.EMW
       CLA     777
       STO     EMSRT
       TRA     EMS1

EMS    STO     777          SAVE RETURN HOP CONSTANT                  B
       STO     V.EMW        SAVE ERROR MESSAGE WORD

       CLA     777
       STO     EMSRT

       PIO     053          READ DISR                                 I
       AND     =O0000006    MASK OUT UNWANTED DISR BITS AND SAVE      B
       STO     DISR

       PIO     023          READ ERROR MONITOR REGISTER               I
       STO     V.EMR
       AND     EMCON        MASK OUT UNWANTED EMR BITS AND SAVE       B
       STO     EMRM

       CLA     V.EMW        WAS ENTRY TO TELEMETER ERROR MESSAGE      Q
       TNZ     EMS1                                                   Y

       CLA     EMRM         DOES MASKED EMR INDICATE BITS OTHER       Q
       AND     =O777776776  THAN SCB
       TNZ     EMS1                                                   Y

       CLA     EMRM
       AND     D.KB17
       ADD     DISR
       XOR     =O0000012    DO BOTH EMR + DISR INDICATE SCB           Q
       TNZ     *+2                                                    N
       TRA     EMS1                                                   Y

       CLA     EMRM         WAS THE MASKED EMR ZERO                   Q
       TNZ     EMS1                                                   N
       HOP     EMSRT        HOP RETURN                                X

EMS1   CLA     D.KB25
       PIO     022          SET ICR1 SELECT G-SYNC CONTROL            I

       CLA     V.STAT       SAVE CALLING ROUTINE STATUS CODE          B
       STO     OLDSTT

*      FIXME: IS THIS PTL CHECK SUFFICIENT?
       SUB     =O12         WAS ENTRY FROM PTL                        Q
       TNZ     EMS2                                                   N

       CLA     D.KBSG                                                 Y
       PIO     016          SET D.O. 13                               I

EMS2   CLA     V.EMW        WAS ENTRY TO TELEMETER ERROR MESSAGE      Q
       TNZ     EMS3                                                   Y
       TRA     EMS4                                                   N

EMS3   TELM    V.EMW        TELEMETER ERROR MESSAGE                   I
       TRA     EMS5

EMS4   TELM    V.EMR        TELEMETER RAW EMR READING                 I

EMS5   CLA     =O47
       HOP     ISS          ISSUE STATUS CODE                         P

       CLA     V.EMW        WAS ENTRY TO TELEMETER ERROR MESSAGE      Q
       TNZ     *+2
       TRA     EMS6

       TELM    V.EMW        TELEMETER ERROR MESSAGE                   I
       HOP     OIGS         OUTPUT INTERRUPT GEN.                     P

EMS6   TELM    V.EMR        TELEMETER RAW EMR READING                 I
       HOP     OIGS         OUTPUT INTERRUPT GEN.                     P

EMS7   PIO     057
       AND     D.KB23       IS SYNC ON                                Q
       TNZ     EMS8                                                   Y
       HOP     PRUS         PTL REALTIME UPDATE SUBROUTINE            P
       TRA     EMS7

EMS8   CLA     OLDSTT
       SUB     =O12         WAS ENTRY FROM PTL                        Q
       TNZ     EMS9                                                   N

       HOP     SRS          RESET SYNC                                P
       TRA     EMS10

EMS9   PIO     043          READ RCA-110A REGISTER                    I
       AND     =O77776
       STO     EMSCMD
       HOP     SRS          RESET SYNC                                P

       CLA     EMSCMD       DOES RCA COMMAND=00                       Q
       TNZ     EMS11                                                  N

EMS10  CLA     OLDSTT       DOES ROUTINE EXIT TO MODE SORT            Q
       TNZ     *+2                                                    N
       HOP     EMSRT        EXIT TO MODE SORT                         X

       CLA     OLDSTT       RESTORE PREV STATUS CODE                  P
       HOP     ISS
       HOP     EMSRT        EXIT HOP RETURN                           X

EMS11  XOR     =O576        IS RCA COMMAND = 77                       Q
       TNZ     EMS7                                                   N
       CLA     =O7          SET EMCON AND EMCON1 = 700000000          B
       STO     EMCON
       STO     EMCON1

       HOP     FBR1         EXIT FORCED BEGIN                         X
